 "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153061374", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976212113", "personaname": "Failbot v2.024", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mattydove/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 2185, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1925, "last_played": 1702352145, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "THe amount of disconnects in this game are beyong frustrating.  It's about a 50/50 chance that you are going to load in with your friends.  Would not recommend.", "timestamp_created": 1701975425, "timestamp_updated": 1701975425, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.518022656440734863", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153050119", "author": {"steamid": "76561198033780418", "personaname": "LIMUNADE≋", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/banser/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 97, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 97, "last_played": 1701882885, "avatar": "6aea803eb29d6a21d5b60d4f3a68ce6a639cbb03"}, "language": "english", "review": "[h1]I can see a good potential in customization and mechanics progression but don't want to deal with anything else 🙈 [/h1]\n\nThis game immediately greets you with dead pan characters. You can hear a voiced dialog but the mouth isn't moving. Same goes to the enemies. There are hords of them and special enemies are a bullet sponges. Imagine smoker in Left 4 Dead but he would have hp almost as a tank. That's what sort of enemies are in this game. \n\nMy favorite part is missing FOV slider ([url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/1549970/discussions/0/3409804429013907335/]and pathetic excuse from players why it's missing[/url]) and eyes strain. After a short session of the game you eyes literally starts to hurt. I have no idea how people let this exist! And you can't remove black borders of your screen either. Also the sound of the guns sounds weak. \n\nI wish that this game could be more than a generic carousel shooter but reality dictates differently. Yeah and instead of gender you have the option between feminine and masculine body types...", "timestamp_created": 1701962277, "timestamp_updated": 1701962411, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.467032968997955322", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153046014", "author": {"steamid": "76561197987874052", "personaname": "Zim", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197987874052/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 847, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 326, "last_played": 1702737722, "avatar": "ed77aec1a1d809cdb7135252947fe1b9db5e7f74"}, "language": "english", "review": "Super fun so far, not sure what people are complaining about, just dont expect much more than waves of enemies from point to point, if you enjoy that like me then your good. also lots to work on upgrading which I like", "timestamp_created": 1701957355, "timestamp_updated": 1701957355, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}